            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Giovanna75"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was looking for a dip to have on hand for snacking on raw veggies, this one fits the bill. Extremely simple and fast to make. Consistency was a bit weird after first mixing, but evens out after some time in the fridge. Lacks the rich creaminess of a dip with sour cream, but good nonetheless."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lizzy Corley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "i used like a ton of mayonnaise and it was still really soupy. I then added some corn starch which significantly helped the consistency.",
            "datePublished": "2017-03-03T17:26:29.830Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "2"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Keyana Gregg"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The flavor was good but the consistency was awful. I used a full cup of mayonnaise and let it set in the fridge for 12 hours and it was still too \"soupy\" and there certainly was not enough for 6 servings. I would try it again with 1 cup of sour cream, 1/2 cup of mayo and 1 tablespoon of water instead of 1 teaspoon.",
            "datePublished": "2015-02-02T11:01:06.070Z"
          }
